OL,3,GNEWSAYouth orchestras could be at risk
OL,4,Adue to further funding cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are fears that funding cuts to
OL,7,Fmusic in schools in Northern Ireland
OL,8,Fcould put youth orchestras at risk.
OL,10,FMore than 2,000 promising young
OL,11,Fmusicians have been told that transport
OL,12,Fto take part in bands and orchestras is
OL,13,Fbeing withdrawn as part of cuts to the
OL,14,FEducation Authority Youth Music
OL,15,FService.
OL,17,FThe Education Authority (EA) is aiming
OL,18,Fto make millions of pounds of savings
OL,19,Fthis year.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
