OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, it has withdrawn advice to
OL,7,Fschools to get pupils to wear more
OL,8,Fclothes rather than turn the heating up
OL,9,Fin cold weather, following criticism
OL,10,Ffrom principals and the children's
OL,11,Fcommissioner.
